{{define "main"}}
<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="page-hero" id="cybersecurity-insurance-hero">
    <div class="hero-content--centered">
        <div class="hero-kicker">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-size-sm">shield_with_heart</span>
            <span class="eyebrow">Cyber Risk Transfer, Backed by Cyber Defense</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
            <span>Cybersecurity Insurance</span> Built on <span>Evidence</span>, Not Assumptions
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-description">
            Tabiri combines penetration testing, continuous monitoring, and practical remediation with an insurance-readiness strategy designed to help organizations understand, reduce, and transfer cyber risk.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Discuss Cyber Insurance Readiness</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Integrated Protection -->
<section class="content-section content-section--muted content-section--border-bottom" id="integrated-protection">
    <div class="section-container">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">Integrated Protection</p>
            <h2 class="section-heading">Reduce the Risk. <span>Prepare to Transfer the Rest.</span></h2>
            <p class="section-intro__description">A point-in-time questionnaire cannot capture a risk environment that changes every day. Our approach keeps technical evidence connected to ongoing risk management.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="trust-card group">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">policy</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Validate Exposure</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Engineer-led penetration testing identifies exploitable attack paths and produces evidence that can support a clearer view of your security posture.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card group">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">monitor_heart</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Monitor Change</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Continuous monitoring detects emerging vulnerabilities and configuration changes between assessments, when yesterday's risk picture may no longer apply.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card group">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">health_and_safety</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Improve Resilience</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Prioritized remediation and ongoing security operations help reduce the likelihood and potential impact of an incident before risk is transferred.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Coverage Areas -->
<section class="content-section content-section--light" id="potential-coverage-areas">
    <div class="method-layout method-layout--coverage">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">Potential Coverage Areas</p>
            <h2 class="section-heading"><span>Financial Protection for</span> <span class="section-heading__accent">Cyber Events</span></h2>
            <p class="body-copy body-copy--spaced">Cyber policies commonly combine first-party expenses with third-party liabilities. Exact coverage, limits, deductibles, conditions, and exclusions vary by carrier and policy.</p>
            <div class="method-note">
                <div class="method-note__content">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>
                    <p class="body-copy-small-compact">Insurance products, where available, are offered through appropriately licensed insurance partners. Coverage is subject to underwriting and the terms of the issued policy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="coverage-grid">
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover coverage-card">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">database</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--nowrap"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Data Recovery</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Costs to restore data and systems damaged, destroyed, or stolen in a covered event.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover coverage-card">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">encrypted</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--nowrap"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Cyber Extortion</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Response expenses associated with ransomware and other covered extortion demands.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover coverage-card">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">notifications</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--nowrap"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Breach Response</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Potential notification, forensic investigation, legal, credit monitoring, and crisis costs.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover coverage-card">
                <div class="card-heading-row card-heading-row--tight">
                    <div class="icon-tile icon-tile--primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-tile__symbol">gavel</span></div>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--nowrap"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Cyber Liability</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Potential network security, privacy, media, and regulatory liabilities arising from a covered incident.</p>
            </article>                   
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Risk Model -->
<section class="content-section content-section--muted content-section--bordered" id="risk-informed-approach">
    <div class="section-container">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">Risk-Informed Approach</p>
            <h2 class="section-heading"><span>Security Evidence</span> That Supports <span>Insurance Readiness</span></h2>
            <p class="section-intro__description">Tabiri helps organizations implement security measures that align with insurance requirements, ensuring readiness and risk mitigation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid feature-grid--four-at-medium">
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="card-heading-row">
                    <span class="risk-step__number">01</span>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Understand the Business</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Review revenue, operations, sensitive data, dependencies, prior incidents, and the financial impact of downtime.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="card-heading-row">
                    <span class="risk-step__number">02</span>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Assess Technical Risk</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Test external and internal systems to identify weaknesses that automated questionnaires and perimeter scans can miss.</p>
            </article>  
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="card-heading-row">
                    <span class="risk-step__number">03</span>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Reduce Exposure</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Prioritize remediation by exploitability and business impact, then verify that material weaknesses are resolved.</p>
            </article>  
            <article class="trust-card-no-hover group">
                <div class="card-heading-row">
                    <span class="risk-step__number">04</span>
                    <h3 class="heading-medium"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Maintain the Evidence</span></h3>
                </div>
                <p class="body-copy-small">Use continuous monitoring and reporting to keep the security posture current through underwriting and renewal cycles.</p>
            </article>                    
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Why Tabiri -->
<section class="content-section content-section--light" id="why-tabiri-insurance">
    <div class="method-layout method-layout--centered">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">Why Tabiri</p>
            <h2 class="section-heading">More Than a <span>One-Time Scan</span></h2>
            <p class="body-copy">Many cyber insurance assessments see only the public perimeter at one moment in time. Tabiri's security services can examine the systems, identities, workflows, and controls behind that perimeter, helping keep your premiums low.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-steps">
            <div class="trust-card-no-hover risk-benefit"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span><div><h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--compact"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Validated Findings</span></h3><p class="body-copy-small-compact">Human-reviewed evidence distinguishes exploitable risk from scanner noise.</p></div></div>
            <div class="trust-card-no-hover risk-benefit"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span><div><h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--compact"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Ongoing Risk Management</span></h3><p class="body-copy-small-compact">Monitoring and remediation continue after the initial assessment.</p></div></div>
            <div class="trust-card-no-hover risk-benefit"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span><div><h3 class="heading-medium heading-medium--compact"><span class="heading-medium__highlight">Aligned Incentives</span></h3><p class="body-copy-small-compact">The goal is not simply to document risk, but to prevent losses and strengthen resilience.</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section class="callout-section callout-section--unbordered callout-section--white" id="cybersecurity-insurance-cta">
    <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout__overlay"></div>
        <div class="callout__content callout__content--narrow">
            <p class="callout__eyebrow">Start with Your Risk</p>
            <h2 class="callout__heading">Build a <span>Stronger Case</span> for <span>Cyber Resilience</span></h2>
            <p class="callout__description">Talk with our team about your environment, insurance goals, and the security evidence needed to move forward.</p>
            <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Start the Conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{{end}}